.TH AUDIO_PLAY 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_play \- Play a sound once at gain 0..1 (1 = as recorded; the master effects gain is applied on top) on a free channel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "void audio_play(const Sound *s, float gain);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Play a sound once at gain 0..1 (1 = as recorded; the master effects gain is applied on top) on a free channel. Fire\-and\-forget: there is no handle, no stop, no way to tell when it ended. Eight effects can play at once; a ninth is dropped silently. Call from update (tick rate) or handle_input (on the press), never from render, which would play it every frame.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audio_music (3),
.BR audio_set_master (3),
.BR Sound (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
